-- --- mission 3, Static: E minor pentatonic, and it still does not move. Barely any pulse; the beating in the top voice is the only thing that throbs.
-- 88 bars, 4m42s. Movements (in bars): I 20, II 14, III 12, IV 10, V 14, VI 12, VII 6.
-- I drone, II the build, III the statement, IV the hollow, V pressure, VI the
-- wide part, VII the descent back into the drone, so bar 88 hands to bar 1
-- without a seam. The body voice runs from level 24 to 98 across those
-- seven, and with no percussion that spread is the whole architecture. ---

m3Pulse : Int -> List Note
m3Pulse i =
    if i == 0 then
        [ nt 0 16 ]

    else if i == 1 then
        [ ntv 41 2 66, nt 0 14 ]

    else if i == 2 then
        [ nt 0 8, ntv 41 2 66, nt 0 6 ]

    else if i == 3 then
        [ nt 41 2, nt 0 6, nt 82 2, nt 0 6 ]

    else if i == 4 then
        [ nt 41 2, nt 0 14 ]

    else if i == 5 then
