-- --- mission 5, Meridian Engine: F minor pentatonic, the heaviest. The lowest pulse in the game, twice a bar at most: slow, and enormous.
-- 86 bars, 4m35s. Movements (in bars): I 16, II 14, III 12, IV 10, V 16, VI 12, VII 6.
-- I drone, II the build, III the statement, IV the hollow, V pressure, VI the
-- wide part, VII the descent back into the drone, so bar 86 hands to bar 1
-- without a seam. The body voice runs from level 28 to 100 across those
-- seven, and with no percussion that spread is the whole architecture. ---

